  <title>Resource diary</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Resources</gui><gui>Resource diary</gui></guiseq> is a
  diary: one entry per day. It shows the chosen day and the same day in each
  of the four years before it, side by side, so you can see what was happening
  this time last year. Type into a day's box; it is saved as you type.</p>

  <p><gui>Previous day</gui> and <gui>Next day</gui> step through the days, or
  click the icon in the date box to choose one. To find an entry by its words,
  use <link xref="resource_search"/>.</p>

</page>
